<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (Modern semiconductor and VLSI systems undergo thousands of test executions with different configurations, workloads, random seeds, and environmental conditions. When failures occur, engineers often have to manually analyze large volumes of logs to determine what caused the failure and which configuration led to it. For example, in a VLSI verification environment, a test may pass under one configuration but fail under another due to a specific combination of parameters or random conditions. The challenge is to develop an AI-powered dashboard that automatically analyzes execution logs and test data, identifies the key factors behind failures and performance variations, predicts potential failures, and recommends the most effective configuration for future test runs.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
